{
  "$schema": "../meta/message.json",
  "message": "UnitStopped",
  "note": "What a server sends to stop a unit where it stands. The header names the unit. A client applies it only where its sync id is not older than the last the unit took, counting a wrap: this message, PathWithSpeed and Path share one count per unit, starting at -1.",
